sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Cashier
    participant UI as POS Interface
    participant API as transactions.php
    participant DB as MySQL-compatible Database
    Cashier->>UI: Scan barcode OR search for item
    UI->>API: GET barcode_lookup OR search_items
    API->>DB: Read active product
    DB-->>API: Name, stored price and available quantity
    API-->>UI: Product data or lookup error
    Cashier->>UI: Enter cash and confirm checkout
    UI->>API: POST complete_sale with cart and payment
    Note over API: Require current active account, refresh role
    API->>DB: BEGIN, lock inventory rows FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>API: Authoritative prices and current stock
    API->>API: Validate quantities, calculate total from stored prices
    API->>DB: Lock and read active shift
    Note over API: Cashier requires own open shift, admin may sell without one
    alt Invalid item, stock, payment or cashier shift
        API->>DB: ROLLBACK
        API-->>UI: Validation error, no sale saved
    else Valid checkout
        API->>DB: Insert transaction and line items
        API->>DB: Conditional stock deductions
        alt Database failure or stock deduction rejected
            API->>DB: ROLLBACK
            API-->>UI: Failure, no partial sale
        else All writes succeed
            API->>DB: COMMIT
            API->>DB: Write audit log after commit
            API-->>UI: Receipt, transaction code and change
            UI->>Cashier: Show receipt, open browser print dialog
        end
    end

